{"title":"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 42","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/a/44a2fc2f53d5841c4c4d52f4410301f9a3161549.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = i^n + i^{-n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"99\" height=\"14\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/c/dac5dec897250384833e3c1b44639bf91cca823a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i = \\sqrt{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"71\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is an integer, then the total number of possible distinct values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/7/9a7233132be27ef4c2437f2459217a939b1e1966.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 2\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 3\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 4\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{more than 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"428\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We first use the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/7/37705541aaf341d7f53c1f44f44d69a9919f0a60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^{-n}=\\frac1{i^n}=\\left(\\frac1i\\right)^n=(-i)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"208\" height=\"44\" />. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/1/2a1f4b994f76715564166ae5baa38b849f3628ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^4=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/4/ca45f78f20d5cf53caf899599c54a5f7cf41f24f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-i)^4=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"19\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/5/fb57d3bd503fe5ba5b565dc135b7b6a0b706c95d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^n$\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/0/9c0a25b14ea4321ef78490dfb07389ccdd16240b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-i)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"18\" /> are periodic with periods at most 4. Therefore, it suffices to check for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/6/226364244a0b56a65dd64531dbd9b766273b32e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=0,1,2,3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"95\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nFor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/3/02349576cee613512cdf301a365f06c0760acab5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/3/b93da1f284ff05c63cdf0966e119f8b335554cac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^0+(-i)^0=1+1=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"175\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d96ecc15129c5631ba4a2c6578e91e3d13e3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59d194a569693acc8d9c6113b4537a0e122046c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^1+(-i)^1=i-i=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"169\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/b/6cb7ae00764b56ee2adf59e78a1ffde9685b80db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/b/bbbb058371a37d360446c4b4b99b034cf0fe56e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^2+(-i)^2=-1-1=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"203\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/5635737307f5f0651cced8ee2e6558a426fd27b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=3$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/9/879ccdf00b7332c0f225f24678f5860b6e176720.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^3+(-i)^3=-i+i=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"184\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Hence, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/8/c88676177603d4e7134e7819bb31db2c8ca62f28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that the powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" /> cycle in cycles of 4. So let's see if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is periodic.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/3/02349576cee613512cdf301a365f06c0760acab5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />: we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d96ecc15129c5631ba4a2c6578e91e3d13e3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />: we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/b/6cb7ae00764b56ee2adf59e78a1ffde9685b80db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />: we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/5635737307f5f0651cced8ee2e6558a426fd27b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=3$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />: we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39cf3e35a4981583288d2a7c4b34989916fb7360.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />: we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> again. Well, it can be seen that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> cycles in periods of 4. Select <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f7bfdbb5e480fd502f53b019a98dbc31f2069ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~hastapasta\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME\" title=\"1957 AHSME\">1957 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1957 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1957\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_41\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 41\">Problem 41</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 43\">Problem 43</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.ph